      "role": "user",
      "content": "a resonant cavity... that's a really powerful way to look at it. i can already feel the difference when i try to visualize it that way.\n\nit's making me realize that my environment is way more influential than i thought. if the ambient noise from other people's \"realities\" can interfere with my signal, then i probably need to be much more selective about where i spend my time and who i interact with. \n\nis there a way to tell if a person or a place is \"frequency-neutral\"? like, how do i scan an environment to see if it's going to support my manifestations or if it's just going to create more static for me to fight through?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
